{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026a7JaoQVMNz1793690239.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>財政司司長陳茂波見記者，簡介2026年國際金融領袖投資峰會相關情況。</p><p></p><p>陳茂波指，峰會匯聚了280位國際金融領袖。當中內地金融機構的分享，讓國際金融界直接了解政策思路和中國市場。國際金融機構亦討論了如何重新審視投資策略。另外，亦關注人工智能發展，看好AI的長遠潛力，並關注其回報周期。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.848675+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:30.375597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:51.461080+00:00","content_hash":"3c4f8f61f1025570f451a0d00987cd1e7484760568b908ae04f27e9ab2545797","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.848675+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}